                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in 8 in No. 9.]</seg></opener>
                <p>This is Baron Holleben’s dispatch to the Yamun, informing the minister that he
                    was the intermediary on Spanish affairs.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 15,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
